---
# Only the brace rule is enforced; see scripts/check-c-braces.py and
# `make check-braces`. ShortStatementLines: 1 leaves a stand-alone single-line
# guard (`if (err) return rc;`) alone. A chained if/else spans several lines,
# so it must be braced even when each body is one line.
Checks: '-*,readability-braces-around-statements'
CheckOptions:
  - key: readability-braces-around-statements.ShortStatementLines
    value: '1'
...
